# Sprint 5.03 Performance
metrics[1]{assigned_ect, unplanned_ect, completed_ect, variance, volatility}:
  16, 0, 16, 0, 0.0%

# Why it matters for designers
closing[1]{content}:
  "Reliability is a baseline, not a target. With our local boundary established, we look ahead to Sprint 5.04: executing the automated catalog promotion pipeline and decoupling our build stages. The kitchen design standard remains secure."
